function enhance(kind){const p=window.LanternWorkshop.plan(s,kind),title={equip:'最強装備',gear:'装備の一括強化',skills:'スキルの一括強化'}[kind];if(!p.events.length){showModal(title,`<p class="note">${kind==='equip'?'今の持ち物で最強の装備です':kind==='gear'?'強化できる装備がないか、コイン・灯晶が足りません':'習得済みスキルのレベルか、素材が足りません'}</p><p class="small">冒険で装備・素材・経験値を集めよう</p>${btn('close','育成へ戻る','primary')}`);return;}const content=enhanceChanges(p);confirm(title+'しますか？',`<p class="small">対象：編成中の ${s.party.length}人 ／ ${p.events.length}件<br>消費：${cost(p.spent)||'なし'}</p>${content}`,()=>{const next=window.LanternWorkshop.commit(s,p);if(!next){closeModal();toast('状態が変わりました　もう一度確認してください');return;}s=next;teleGrowth(kind==='equip'?'equip_best':kind==='gear'?'gear_upgrade':'skill_upgrade',p.events.length,p.powerAfter-p.powerBefore);closeModal();render();showModal(title+' 完了',`<div class="enhance-emblem">✦</div><span class="eyebrow">ENHANCEMENT COMPLETE</span><div class="enhance-power"><small>編成戦力</small><strong>${fmt(p.powerAfter)}</strong><b>+${fmt(p.powerAfter-p.powerBefore)}</b></div>${content}<p class="small">消費 ${cost(p.spent)||'なし'} ／ 自動保存済み</p>${btn('close','育成へ戻る','primary')}`,'enhancement');$('modal').classList.add('enhancement-veil');A.sfx('complete');},'強化する');}
function enhanceChanges(p){return `<p class="power">戦力 ${fmt(p.powerBefore)} → ${fmt(p.powerAfter)} <span class="change">+${fmt(p.powerAfter-p.powerBefore)}</span></p><div class="upgrade-details">${p.before.filter(a=>p.events.some(e=>e.id===a.id)).map(a=>`<section class="upgrade-member"><div class="row">${face(a.id)}<h3>${R.chars[a.id].name}</h3></div>${changes(a.stats,p.after.find(b=>b.id===a.id).stats)}${p.events.filter(e=>e.id===a.id).map(e=>`<p class="small">${escape(e.label)}<br><span class="upgrade-from">${e.category==='equip'?'':e.category==='gear'?'+':'Lv.'}${escape(e.before)}</span> → <b class="change">${e.category==='equip'?'':e.category==='gear'?'+':'Lv.'}${escape(e.after)}</b></p>`).join('')}</section>`).join('')}</div>`;}
function showItem(id){const x=s.gear.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!x)return;const owner=s.equipped.findIndex(l=>Object.values(l).includes(id)),can=x.slot!=='weapon'||x.role===selected,z=R.gearStats(x),u={...x,rank:Math.min(5,x.rank+1)},valid=owner>=0?owner:selected;showModal(escape(R.gearName(x)),`<p class="small">${R.rarities[x.rarity].name} ／ 第${x.tier}章の装備${x.affix?' ／ '+R.prefixes.find(a=>a.id===x.affix).name:''}</p>${owner>=0?`<p class="note">${R.chars[owner].name}が装備中</p>`:''}${statsHTML(z)}<div class="row">${btn('equipItem',R.chars[selected].name+'に装備','primary',`data-id="${id}" ${!can||owner===selected?'disabled':''}`)}${btn('lockItem',x.locked?'ロック解除':'ロック','','data-id="'+id+'"')}</div><div class="rule"></div><h3>強化 ${x.rank}/5</h3>${x.rank<5?changes(owner>=0?R.stats(s,owner):z,owner>=0?(()=>{const copy=R.copy(s);copy.gear.find(a=>a.id===id).rank++;return R.stats(copy,owner);})():R.gearStats(u))+`<p class="small">${cost(R.upgradeCost(x))} ／ 強化は必ず成功</p>`:'<p class="small">最大まで強化済み</p>'}<div class="row">${btn('upgradeItem','強化する','primary',`data-id="${id}" ${x.rank===5?'disabled':''}`)}${btn('salvageItem','分解','','data-id="'+id+'" '+(R.protectedItem(s,x)?'disabled':''))}</div><p class="small">装備中・ロック中は分解できません</p>`);}
function slot(id,kind){selected=id;const current=s.equipped[id][kind],xs=s.gear.filter(x=>x.slot===kind&&(kind!=='weapon'||x.role===id)).sort((a,b)=>Number(b.id===current)-Number(a.id===current)||R.power(R.gearStats(b))-R.power(R.gearStats(a)));showModal(R.chars[id].name+' ／ '+R.slotNames[kind],`<div class="stack">${xs.map(x=>{const owner=s.equipped.findIndex(l=>Object.values(l).includes(x.id)),copy=R.copy(s);R.equip(copy,id,x.id);const diff=R.power(R.stats(copy,id))-R.power(R.stats(s,id));return btn('item',`<span class="gear-card-heading"><em class="rarity-badge">${R.rarities[x.rarity].name.split(' ')[0]}</em><strong>${escape(R.gearName(x))}</strong></span><span class="gear-card-tags">${owner>=0?`<span class="equipped-label">✓ ${R.chars[owner].name}が装備中</span>`:'未装備'}<span>装備評価 ${R.power(R.gearStats(x))}</span></span><small class="gear-statline">${Object.entries(R.gearStats(x)).filter(([,v])=>v).map(([k,v])=>names[k]+' +'+v).join(' · ')}</small>${x.id!==current?`<small class="${diff>=0?'change':'negative'}">${R.chars[id].name} 戦力 ${diff>=0?'+':''}${diff}</small>`:''}`,'quest '+(owner>=0?'equipped-gear':''),`data-id="${x.id}" style="--rarity:${R.rarities[x.rarity].color}"`);}).join('')}</div>`);}

function equipItem(id){const x=s.gear.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!x)return;const before=R.stats(s,selected),copy=R.copy(s);if(!R.equip(copy,selected,id))return;const oldOwner=s.equipped.findIndex(l=>Object.values(l).includes(id));confirm('装備を変更しますか？',`<h3>${R.chars[selected].name} ／ ${escape(R.gearName(x))}</h3>${changes(before,R.stats(copy,selected))}${oldOwner>=0&&oldOwner!==selected?`<p class="small">${R.chars[oldOwner].name}から移します</p>${changes(R.stats(s,oldOwner),R.stats(copy,oldOwner))}`:''}`,()=>{const prev=R.power(R.stats(s,selected));if(!R.equip(s,selected,id))return;teleGrowth('equip_manual',1,R.power(R.stats(s,selected))-prev);closeModal();render();toast(R.chars[selected].name+' 戦力 '+(R.power(R.stats(s,selected))-prev));});}
function bulk(include=false){const xs=s.gear.filter(x=>!R.protectedItem(s,x)&&x.rank===0&&x.rarity<=(include?1:0)),ids=xs.map(x=>x.id);confirm('一括分解しますか？',`<p class="note">未装備・未強化の${include?'旅装と上質':'旅装'} ${xs.length}点<br>灯晶 +${xs.reduce((a,x)=>a+R.salvage(x),0)}</p><div class="modal-list stack">${xs.map(x=>`<p class="small">${escape(R.gearName(x))} ／ ${R.rarities[x.rarity].name}</p>`).join('')||'<p class="small">対象の装備はありません</p>'}</div><p class="small">装備中・ロック中・強化済みは除外</p>${btn('bulkMore',include?'旅装だけを選ぶ':'上質も対象にする','','data-more="'+!include+'"')}`,()=>{if(!ids.length){closeModal();return;}const n=R.dismantle(s,ids);if(n===false){toast('対象が変わりました　選び直してください');return;}teleGrowth('dismantle',ids.length);closeModal();render();toast(ids.length+'点を分解　灯晶 +'+n);A.sfx('reward');});}
function decks(){showModal('編成とデッキ',`<div class="row">${s.decks.map((d,i)=>btn('deck',`編成 ${i+1}`,s.deck===i?'active':'',`data-id="${i}"`)).join('')}</div><div class="deck-slots">${Array.from({length:4},(_,i)=>{const id=s.party[i];return btn('crewEdit',id!==undefined?`${face(id)}<strong>${R.chars[id].name}</strong><small>${R.chars[id].job}</small>`:'＋<small>空き枠</small>','','data-id="'+i+'"');}).join('')}</div><div class="formation-summary"><strong>戦力 ${fmt(R.total(s))}</strong><p>${s.party.some(id=>R.role(id)===2)?'回復役あり':'回復役なし'} ／ ${s.party.some(id=>['guard','bulwark'].includes(R.chars[id].trait)||id===3)?'防御支援あり':'防御支援なし'}</p></div><div class="row">${btn('storyParty','物語の仲間で編成','primary')}${btn('autoParty','おまかせ編成')}${btn('saveDeck','編成を保存')}</div><p class="small">おまかせはアレンを軸に、回復役・防御支援を優先<br>上から順に行動 ／ 同じ仲間は1枠まで</p><div class="rule"></div><p class="small">仲間 ${s.unlocked.length}人 ／ 最大4人で出撃</p>`);}
